  "description": "Blazor form validation on FluentValidation: the validation engine and a headless component kit, for WebAssembly and every interactive render mode. Use FormidableForm, or attach to the EditForm and EditContext you already have. A message waits until the visitor has earned it. Warnings never block a submit, and errors stay on their row object when a list reorders.",
